0..56 Comment "//! `state-wp` observes state as predicate transformers."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..139 Comment "//! A transformer maps a postcondition and initial state to a precondition. It"
140..183 Comment "//! has type `((A, S) => Type, S) => Type`."
184..187 Comment "//!"
188..267 Comment "//! The handler maps `get` and `put` into state predicates. The scope satisfies"
268..344 Comment "//! state laws. The observation is a monad morphism from state programs. The"
345..395 Comment "//! normaliser computes a precondition through the"
396..430 Comment "//! fold in `tree-state-wp.gandr`."
431..434 Comment "//!"
435..451 Comment "//! - see: #2754"
452..500 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
501..616 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
618..648 Comment "// The import gives StateLaws."
